    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/4ded6048ed6b528382b25cf457494811.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span><strong>Neon Overdrive is a procedural generated, rogue-like, VR shooter set in an 80s-inspired Retro Futuristic Sci-Fi world. Fight your way through hordes of Exo Bots utilizing four unique character classes, special abilities and a variety of perk combinations.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/a3c8e2c8217234e48fe2632b43f19730.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span><strong>Play to unlock 4 Unique Classes, each with their own Weapons and set of abilities. Master each class, complete class specific challenges for cosmetic rewards. Each class provides a new playstyle and an opportunity to craft new builds.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/652413ca912c0854c90ab17992705335.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/4c8b5bfdff7b5b7240553c86b7c5b7cf.poster.avif?t=1755625235\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/4c8b5bfdff7b5b7240553c86b7c5b7cf.webm?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/4c8b5bfdff7b5b7240553c86b7c5b7cf.mp4?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Stack, mix, and match over 50 perks! Providing you with the tools to make ever run unique. From common stat buffs to major ability and gameplay shake ups, strategically stack your perks to craft your most devastating build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Overdrive Mechanic is a dynamic difficulty modifier that gives enemies new abilities, boosted stats, and an a brand new look!</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/360afe132bbcd1a6324bdd2d05c3a067.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/efa86d9aeef96aa27144777c42062268.poster.avif?t=1755625235\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/efa86d9aeef96aa27144777c42062268.webm?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/efa86d9aeef96aa27144777c42062268.mp4?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Overdrive Mechanic is a dynamic difficulty modifier that gives enemies new abilities, boosted stats, and an a brand new look!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/5588608ab01ba53bf19895367676f2c9.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/d358bf0c309e55fd07958cfff73f8666.poster.avif?t=1755625235\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/d358bf0c309e55fd07958cfff73f8666.webm?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/d358bf0c309e55fd07958cfff73f8666.mp4?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels, Dynamic Difficulty Scaling, Challenges , and Cosmetic Reward Systems all keep you playing and replaying. Test your skills and craft your perfect build to complete challenges, unlock difficulty modifiers and unlock new classes or cosmetics!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/8c6088f3be2f2bbf116873fdaaf5397b.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/628c93ee68bbb948d019dc10bba9daae.poster.avif?t=1755625235\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/628c93ee68bbb948d019dc10bba9daae.webm?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/628c93ee68bbb948d019dc10bba9daae.mp4?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A Variety of Boss Battle to Test you Skill and Perks! Each with their own unique attacks and mechanics.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/4ded6048ed6b528382b25cf457494811.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span><strong>Neon Overdrive is a procedural generated, rogue-like, VR shooter set in an 80s-inspired Retro Futuristic Sci-Fi world. Fight your way through hordes of Exo Bots utilizing four unique character classes, special abilities and a variety of perk combinations.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/a3c8e2c8217234e48fe2632b43f19730.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span><strong>Play to unlock 4 Unique Classes, each with their own Weapons and set of abilities. Master each class, complete class specific challenges for cosmetic rewards. Each class provides a new playstyle and an opportunity to craft new builds.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/652413ca912c0854c90ab17992705335.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/4c8b5bfdff7b5b7240553c86b7c5b7cf.poster.avif?t=1755625235\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/4c8b5bfdff7b5b7240553c86b7c5b7cf.webm?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/4c8b5bfdff7b5b7240553c86b7c5b7cf.mp4?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Stack, mix, and match over 50 perks! Providing you with the tools to make ever run unique. From common stat buffs to major ability and gameplay shake ups, strategically stack your perks to craft your most devastating build.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Overdrive Mechanic is a dynamic difficulty modifier that gives enemies new abilities, boosted stats, and an a brand new look!</strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/360afe132bbcd1a6324bdd2d05c3a067.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/efa86d9aeef96aa27144777c42062268.poster.avif?t=1755625235\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/efa86d9aeef96aa27144777c42062268.webm?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/efa86d9aeef96aa27144777c42062268.mp4?t=1755625235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>The Overdrive Mechanic is a dynamic difficulty modifier that gives enemies new abilities, boosted stats, and an a brand new look!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/5588608ab01ba53bf19895367676f2c9.avif?t=1755625235\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575030/extras/d358bf0c309e55fd07958cfff73f8666.poster.avif?t=1755625235\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste